      Task /Script/DreamStateTreeTests.DstTestTask
        Key Root/Fight/Task[0]
        Bind Strike
        Arg Instance InputValue <- Parameters:Speed
        Arg Instance PayloadAmount <- StateEvent:Root/Fight:Payload</Script/DreamStateTreeTests.DstTestPayload>.Amount
        Arg Instance PayloadSeverity <- StateEvent:Root/Fight:Payload</Script/DreamStateTreeTests.DstTestPayload>.Severity
        Arg Instance bFlag <- StateEvent:Root/Fight:Payload</Script/DreamStateTreeTests.DstTestPayload>.bCritical
      State Root/Fight/Light
        Type State
